@insertcopying

  Demo Notes lists text files by title so that you can find and visit
notes without remembering their file names.  This manual explains
how to use the list and how Lisp programs can read the same entries.
@end ifnottex

@menu
* Using: Using Demo Notes. Opening and working with a note list.
